including scripts to control those activities.  However, it does not
include the work's System Libraries, or general-purpose tools or generally
available free programs which are used unmodified in performing those
activities but which are not part of the work.  For an executable work,
Corresponding Source includes the interface definition files associated
with source files of the work.

